* the fuller story is edited and original rather than an unapproved verbatim eulogy
* the fuller story preserves important facts
* the fuller story appears after the Remembering section
* the Remembering section and fuller story do not unnecessarily repeat each other
* the ZIP contains the folder itself, not just two loose files
* no unnecessary duplicate images are included
* no additional artwork has been generated after the final image was supplied

Do not generate additional artwork once the final image has been supplied.

